@startuml
actor Explorer
participant "React UI" as UI
participant "FastAPI" as API
participant "PlanetCatalogService" as Service
participant "IPlanetRepository" as Repository
participant "ESICalculator" as ESI
Explorer -> UI : select 2–4 planets
UI -> API : GET /api/planets/compare?planet_ids=...
API -> Service : compare(ids)
Service -> Service : validate distinct count
Service -> Repository : find_by_ids(ids)
Repository --> Service : Planet aggregates
loop each selected planet
  Service -> ESI : calculate(planet)
  ESI --> Service : ESIResult + zone status
end
Service --> API : ordered comparison details
API --> UI : 200 JSON
@enduml
